# Route: guide 23 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 46 to
# 48, 27 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Feralas): Camp Mojache -> Gordunni Outpost -> Camp Mojache -> Ruins of
# Isildien -> Feral Scar Vale -> Grimtotem Compound -> Camp Mojache ->
# Grimtotem Compound -> The Writhing Deep -> Camp Mojache -> The Writhing Deep
# -> Camp Mojache -> Feral Scar Vale -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Dark Heart (3062; Edana Hatetalon
# 50).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2854 Wild
# Leather Armor; 2855 Wild Leather Shoulders; 2856 Wild Leather Vest; 2857
# Wild Leather Helmet; 2858 Wild Leather Boots; 2859 Wild Leather Leggings;
# 2860 Master of the Wild Leather.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends
# (7481), Lethtendris's Web (7489).

